{"nodes": [{"id": "cipp_docs_legacy_setup_hidden_from_nav_resources_how_cipp_evaluates_roles_doc", "label": "How CIPP Evaluates Roles", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "CIPP/docs/legacy-setup-hidden-from-nav/resources/how-cipp-evaluates-roles.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "cipp_docs_legacy_setup_hidden_from_nav_resources_how_cipp_evaluates_roles_builtin_role_ceiling", "label": "Built-in Role as Ceiling", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "multiple built-in role memberships don't stack, the single highest role wins, and admin/superadmin ignore custom roles entirely so a custom role can never restrict an admin", "source_file": "CIPP/docs/legacy-setup-hidden-from-nav/resources/how-cipp-evaluates-roles.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "cipp_docs_legacy_setup_hidden_from_nav_resources_how_cipp_evaluates_roles_custom_role_allowlist", "label": "Custom Role as Explicit Allow-list", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "a custom role is an explicit allow-list; any permission category left unset is treated as None, and without a base role a custom role applies on its own with no ceiling", "source_file": "CIPP/docs/legacy-setup-hidden-from-nav/resources/how-cipp-evaluates-roles.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "cipp_docs_legacy_setup_hidden_from_nav_resources_how_cipp_evaluates_roles_per_role_tenant_scope", "label": "Per-Role Tenant Scope Evaluation", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "with multiple custom roles, tenant scope is evaluated per role not pooled; a single role must grant both the required permission and access to the target tenant", "source_file": "CIPP/docs/legacy-setup-hidden-from-nav/resources/how-cipp-evaluates-roles.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "autho